---
title: Notification Service Flow
---
flowchart TD
  U([User]) -->|"user action"| P["Header bell + NotificationsProvider"]
  P <-->|"request / rendered data"| H["useNotificationsContext"]
  H <-->|"query request / cached response"| Q["React Query cache<br/>(keys, refetch, invalidate)"]
  Q <-->|"fetch request / parsed response"| A["notificationApi"]
  A <-->|"HTTP request / HTTP response"| C["apiClient (Axios)<br/>token injection - 401 refresh - 403 role refresh"]
  C <-->|"REST request / JSON response"| S[("Notification Service")]
  P -->|"renders"| UI
  subgraph UI[Page interactions]
    direction LR
    S0["Poll / receive notifications"]
    S1["Unread badge count"]
    S2["Mark read / mark all read"]
    S3["Deep link to related request"]
    S0 ~~~ S1 ~~~ S2 ~~~ S3
  end
  C -. "error response" .-> E["ApiErrorBoundary + toast"]
  E ~~~ UI

  %% ---- Key decisions ----
  P -->|"evaluate"| X0
  X0{"Unread notifications?"} -->|"yes"| X1["Show badge count"]
  X0 -->|"no"| X2["Plain bell icon"]
  X3{"Notification has related request?"} -->|"yes"| X4["Deep link to request"]
  X3 -->|"no"| X5["Mark read only"]

